{{!
    @template tool_lp/course_competency_statistics

    The proficiency statistics of a course's competencies, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/course_competency_statistics of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    admin/tool/lp/templates/course_competency_statistics.mustache. Re-diff it against that file on
    every core upgrade. The course competencies page includes it.

    Kept from core: the wrapper's data-region="coursecompetencystatistics"; the progress bar through
    tool_lp/progress_bar with the same three blocks and the same sentence ("You are proficient in x
    out of y competencies in this course", which tool_lp's Behat reads); the links to
    #competency-info-link-<competency id>, the anchors the course competencies page draws; the
    shortname triple-stashed and the idnumber double-stashed. See
    competency/classes/external/course_competency_statistics_exporter.php for the context.
    Changed: the block is a card (dim-comp-card dim-comp-stats); the competencies most often not
    proficient are a list of warning chips, each with an icon, where core drew a paragraph per name
    inside a link.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * competencycount, proficientcompetencycount, proficientcompetencypercentage,
      proficientcompetencypercentageformatted
    * canbegradedincourse, canmanagecoursecompetencies - booleans
    * leastproficientcount, leastproficient - array of id, shortname, idnumber

    Example context (json):
    {
        "competencycount": 4,
        "canbegradedincourse": true,
        "canmanagecoursecompetencies": true,
        "proficientcompetencycount": 3,
        "proficientcompetencypercentage": 75,
        "proficientcompetencypercentageformatted": 75.0,
        "leastproficientcount": 1,
        "leastproficient": [
            { "id": 1, "shortname": "Communicate clearly", "idnumber": "COMM-1" }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#competencycount}}
<div data-region="coursecompetencystatistics" class="dim-comp-card dim-comp-stats">
    {{#canbegradedincourse}}
        {{< tool_lp/progress_bar}}
            {{$progresstext}}
                {{#str}}xcompetenciesproficientoutofyincourse, tool_lp, { "x": "{{proficientcompetencycount}}", "y": "{{competencycount}}" } {{/str}}
            {{/progresstext}}
            {{$percentage}}{{proficientcompetencypercentage}}{{/percentage}}
            {{$percentlabel}}{{proficientcompetencypercentageformatted}}&nbsp;%{{/percentlabel}}
        {{/tool_lp/progress_bar}}
    {{/canbegradedincourse}}
    {{#canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
    {{#leastproficientcount}}
    <div class="dim-comp-section">
        <p class="dim-comp-eyebrow">{{#str}}competenciesmostoftennotproficientincourse, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
        <ul class="dim-comp-stats__list">
            {{#leastproficient}}
            <li class="dim-comp-stats__item">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <a href="#competency-info-link-{{id}}">{{{shortname}}} <em class="dim-comp-idnumber">{{idnumber}}</em></a>
            </li>
            {{/leastproficient}}
        </ul>
    </div>
    {{/leastproficientcount}}
    {{/canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
</div>
{{/competencycount}}
